1, sp = 0, and w the next valley. Unwrap the indices along v, . . . , p, . . . , w, and put r = p−v ≥ 1,
d = w − p ≥ 1. Apply the construction to every such block once around the labelled cycle. This
convention does not quotient by rotation and is independent of the valley used to start reading.
    Substitution in (1) gives all four local equations:

